MOTION OPL 20261110/8
WHEREAS at the OPL Board meeting of September 8, 2026, the Board approved an increase to 2027 OPL User Fees pertaining to the rental of meeting rooms, applicable to rooms booked in 2026 for rentals in 2027, implemented by staff on September 15, 2026;
WHEREAS ten (10) of OPL’s meeting rooms are in branches that are co-located with City of Ottawa Recreation facilities, and as such, OPL has a long-standing practice of aligning with the City's meeting room rental rates for comparable spaces;
WHEREAS the City’s Recreation, Culture, and Facility Services recently advised OPL of their decision to remove the proposed 2027 fee increase, pending Council consideration in February 2027, and advised that they will process refunds for the rate difference for rental permits confirmed for 2027;
WHEREAS since the date of implementation, there have been fewer than 50 advance booking requests made for OPL meeting rooms for 2027;  
THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED that OPL staff remove the 2027 User Fee increase for meeting room rentals to ensure continued alignment with City facilities, and that staff process refunds for the cost difference of bookings already confirmed.
Results: Carried
